<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Chronos: prediction markets resolved by an autonomous oracle</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Chronos is a prediction market protocol on Arc. An autonomous AI oracle finds events, opens markets and resolves outcomes on-chain in USDC." />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;450;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/build.css" />

  <script>
    window.CHRONOS_API_URL   = '<%= apiUrl %>';
    window.CHRONOS_CONTRACT  = '<%= contractAddress %>';
    window.CHRONOS_USDC      = '<%= usdcAddress %>';
    window.CHRONOS_CHAIN_ID  = <%= chainId %>;
    window.CHRONOS_EXPLORER  = '<%= explorerUrl %>';
    window.CHRONOS_NETWORK   = '<%= networkName %>';
    window.CHRONOS_FEE_PCT   = <%= feePct %>;
  </script>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══ Landing ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div id="landing">
  <header class="lp-nav">
    <div class="lp-nav-in">
      <a class="lp-brand" href="#" aria-label="Chronos home">
        <span class="logo-mark"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></span>
        <span class="brand-name">Chronos</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="lp-links" aria-label="Sections">
        <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        <a href="#oracle">Oracle</a>
        <a href="#fees">Fees and refunds</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="lp-actions">
        <% if (contractAddress) { %><a class="btn btn-quiet" href="<%= explorerUrl %>/address/<%= contractAddress %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contract</a><% } %>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-launch>Launch app</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <section class="lp-hero">
        <div>
          <h1>Prediction markets that resolve themselves</h1>
          <p class="lead">Chronos is an autonomous AI oracle on Arc. It finds real-world events, opens YES or NO markets, gathers evidence after the deadline and settles the outcome on-chain in USDC.</p>
          <div class="lp-ctas">
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-launch>Open markets</button>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg" href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card lp-preview" role="img" aria-label="Example markets">
          <div class="cap">Example markets</div>
          <ul class="rows">
            <li class="row">
              <div class="top"><span class="status"><i></i>Open</span><span class="countdown">23h 14m left</span></div>
              <div class="row-title">Will the Fed hold rates at the next FOMC meeting?</div>
              <div class="split"><div class="split-track"><div class="split-yes" style="width:62%"></div></div><div class="split-labels"><span>Yes 62%</span><span>No 38%</span></div></div>
            </li>
            <li class="row">
              <div class="top"><span class="status status-resolved"><i></i>Resolved</span><span class="tag tag-yes">Yes</span></div>
              <div class="row-title">Will CPI data be released on schedule this month?</div>
              <div class="split"><div class="split-track"><div class="split-yes" style="width:81%"></div></div><div class="split-labels"><span>Yes 81%</span><span>No 19%</span></div></div>
            </li>
            <li class="row">
              <div class="top"><span class="status status-closed"><i></i>Awaiting oracle</span><span class="countdown">Trading closed</span></div>
              <div class="row-title">Will the next OPEC+ meeting extend current output cuts?</div>
              <div class="split"><div class="split-track"><div class="split-yes" style="width:47%"></div></div><div class="split-labels"><span>Yes 47%</span><span>No 53%</span></div></div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="metrics lp-facts" style="margin-bottom:80px">
        <div class="metric"><div class="k">Market type</div><div class="v">Yes / No</div></div>
        <div class="metric"><div class="k">Protocol fee</div><div class="v"><%= feePct %>%</div><div class="n">On profit only</div></div>
        <div class="metric"><div class="k">Minimum stake</div><div class="v">0.10 <small>USDC</small></div></div>
        <div class="metric"><div class="k">Settlement</div><div class="v">On-chain</div><div class="n"><%= networkName %></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="how-it-works" class="lp-section">
      <div class="lp-wrap">
        <h2>From event to payout in four steps</h2>
        <div class="lp-steps">
          <div class="lp-step"><span class="n">1</span><h3>Discover</h3><p>The oracle searches for timely, verifiable events and turns them into binary questions, up to three a day.</p></div>
          <div class="lp-step"><span class="n">2</span><h3>Trade</h3><p>Connect a wallet and stake from 0.10 USDC on Yes or No before the trading deadline. Funds sit in the contract.</p></div>
          <div class="lp-step"><span class="n">3</span><h3>Resolve</h3><p>After the deadline the oracle weighs evidence from several sources and resolves on-chain once confidence passes 85%.</p></div>
          <div class="lp-step"><span class="n">4</span><h3>Get paid</h3><p>Chronos pays winners automatically: their share of the pool minus the <%= feePct %>% fee on profit lands in their wallet. If the oracle misses its deadline, everyone is refunded the same way.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="oracle" class="lp-section">
      <div class="lp-wrap lp-split">
        <div>
          <h2>An oracle with no operator</h2>
          <p class="lead">Chronos runs on a continuous loop. It finds events with Parallel Search, reasons about likely outcomes, collects evidence and submits signed resolutions straight to the smart contract. Nobody has to approve a result.</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="lp-defs" style="margin-top:4px">
          <div><dt>Market discovery</dt><dd>Publishes up to 3 new markets per day.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Confidence threshold</dt><dd>Resolves only when confidence is above 85%. Anything less is left unresolved.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Deadline guarantee</dt><dd>If the resolution deadline passes, anyone can trigger a full refund.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Immutable results</dt><dd>Resolutions are written to the contract and can’t be changed afterwards.</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="fees" class="lp-section">
      <div class="lp-wrap">
        <h2>Simple fees, safe refunds</h2>
        <dl class="lp-defs" style="margin-top:40px">
          <div><dt>Fee on profit only</dt><dd>The <%= feePct %>% protocol fee applies to winners’ profit. Original stakes and losing positions are never charged.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Full refund guarantee</dt><dd>If the oracle misses its deadline, every participant gets their exact USDC back, sent to them automatically.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>USDC on Arc</dt><dd>Arc uses USDC as its gas token, so there’s no ETH to buy. Every stake, fee and payout is in USDC with sub-second finality.</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lp-cta">
      <div class="lp-wrap">
        <div><h2>Make your first prediction</h2><p>Connect a wallet and browse open markets on <%= networkName %>.</p></div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-launch>Launch app</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="lp-foot">
    <div class="lp-wrap">
      <span>Chronos Protocol · <%= networkName %></span>
      <span>
        <% if (contractAddress) { %>Contract <a class="mono" href="<%= explorerUrl %>/address/<%= contractAddress %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><%= contractAddress.slice(0,6) %>…<%= contractAddress.slice(-4) %></a> · <% } %>Testnet only. No real funds.
      </span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>

<!-- ═══ App ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div id="app" hidden>
  <div id="toast-container" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <div class="backdrop" id="sidebar-backdrop"></div>

  <div class="app">
    <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar" aria-label="Main">
      <div class="sidebar-brand">
        <span class="logo-mark"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></span>
        <span class="brand-name">Chronos</span>
      </div>

      <nav class="sidebar-nav">
        <div class="nav-group">Protocol</div>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#overview" data-page="overview">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg>
          Overview
        </a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#markets" data-page="markets">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="20" x2="4" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="20" y1="20" x2="20" y2="14"/></svg>
          Markets
        </a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#positions" data-page="positions">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 12V8H6a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h12v4"/><path d="M4 6v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14v-4"/><path d="M18 12a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h4v-4z"/></svg>
          My positions
        </a>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#resolutions" data-page="resolutions">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
          Resolutions
        </a>

        <div class="nav-group">Intelligence</div>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#agent" data-page="agent">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.9 4.9l2.1 2.1M17 17l2.1 2.1M4.9 19.1L7 17M17 7l2.1-2.1"/></svg>
          Oracle
        </a>

        <div class="nav-group">System</div>
        <a class="nav-item" href="#settings" data-page="settings">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="21" x2="4" y2="14"/><line x1="4" y1="10" x2="4" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="20" y1="21" x2="20" y2="16"/><line x1="20" y1="12" x2="20" y2="3"/><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="7" y2="14"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="15" y2="8"/><line x1="17" y1="16" x2="23" y2="16"/></svg>
          Settings
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-foot"><span class="status"><i></i></span><%= networkName %></div>
    </aside>

    <div class="main">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-left">
          <button id="sidebar-toggle" class="btn btn-secondary btn-icon menu-btn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="sidebar" aria-expanded="false">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
          </button>
          <span class="topbar-network status"><i></i><%= networkName %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-right">
          <span id="usdc-balance-display" class="topbar-balance" hidden><span id="usdc-balance-value">—</span> USDC</span>
          <div id="wallet-btn-container"></div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main id="page-root"></main>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="module" src="/assets/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
